    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch05-10: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.81";
    dc:description "The systems are finite-description programs and their claimed prevalence can be directly estimated or enumerated. Existing computation can resolve bounded horizons and frequencies, but not prove unrestricted randomness for all qualifying trajectories.";
