    dc:type "resolution-route/computation";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Enumerate the stated local rewiring-rule classes, run each from standardized initial networks, and classify node-count series for repetition, nesting, and statistical irregularity. Estimate the fraction of distance-two rules meeting preregistered randomness criteria and test the restricted-class repetition assertion.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-gpt-5.6-sol-medium>;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Apparent randomness is test-dependent.", "Long transients can masquerade as nonrepetition.", "The exact rule grammar and equivalence classes affect the one-in-10,000 frequency.";
